{
  "_readme": [
    "Pull rates for the EV model, as EXPECTED CARDS PER PACK per bucket.",
    "Nobody publishes official odds — not Pokemon, not Bandai, not Riot. Every number",
    "here comes from community pack-opening studies, so each template carries its",
    "sample size and a confidence flag. Expected-count form is deliberate: EV is",
    "linear in it, so the model stays exact without pretending to know slot internals.",
    "A rate matches buckets by rarity/printing/variant; when several buckets match,",
    "they are weighted by how many cards each holds, because a pull is uniform over cards."
  ],
